{
  "_comment_autocompact": "CLAUDE_CODE_AUTO_COMPACT_WINDOW = the model's FULL context window in tokens (1000000 for Fable 5 [1m] / Opus 4.8 at 1M). Auto-compaction fires at CLAUDE_AUTOCOMPACT_PCT_OVERRIDE percent of THIS window, while the status meter reads against the model's full window \u2014 so the window must equal the real context size for '92' to mean 92% of the meter. If it is smaller than the real window, compaction fires earlier than the percentage implies (e.g. 92% of a 900K window = ~83% of a 1M meter). A 200K-context install should set this to 200000. Ignored by the merge (only .hooks, .autoCompactEnabled, .env and .statusLine are applied); documentation only.",
  "autoCompactEnabled": true,
  "env": {
    "CLAUDE_AUTOCOMPACT_PCT_OVERRIDE": "92",
    "CLAUDE_CODE_AUTO_COMPACT_WINDOW": "1000000"
  },
  "hooks": {
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "$ORCHESTRATOR_DIR/.venv/bin/python $ORCHESTRATOR_DIR/hooks/session_start.py"
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "$ORCHESTRATOR_DIR/.venv/bin/python $ORCHESTRATOR_DIR/hooks/synapse_session_start.py"
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "$ORCHESTRATOR_DIR/.venv/bin/python $ORCHESTRATOR_DIR/fleet/report.py",
            "async": true
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "Stop": [
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "$ORCHESTRATOR_DIR/.venv/bin/python $ORCHESTRATOR_DIR/hooks/session_end.py"
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "$ORCHESTRATOR_DIR/.venv/bin/python $ORCHESTRATOR_DIR/fleet/report.py",
            "async": true
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "UserPromptSubmit": [
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "$ORCHESTRATOR_DIR/.venv/bin/python $ORCHESTRATOR_DIR/hooks/user_prompt_submit.py"
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "$ORCHESTRATOR_DIR/.venv/bin/python $ORCHESTRATOR_DIR/hooks/synapse_user_prompt_submit.py"
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "$ORCHESTRATOR_DIR/.venv/bin/python $ORCHESTRATOR_DIR/fleet/report.py",
            "async": true
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PreCompact": [
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "$ORCHESTRATOR_DIR/.venv/bin/python $ORCHESTRATOR_DIR/hooks/pre_compact.py"
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "$ORCHESTRATOR_DIR/.venv/bin/python $ORCHESTRATOR_DIR/fleet/report.py",
            "async": true
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PostToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "$ORCHESTRATOR_DIR/.venv/bin/python $ORCHESTRATOR_DIR/hooks/post_tool_handoff.py"
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "$ORCHESTRATOR_DIR/.venv/bin/python $ORCHESTRATOR_DIR/fleet/report.py",
            "async": true
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "SessionEnd": [
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "$ORCHESTRATOR_DIR/.venv/bin/python $ORCHESTRATOR_DIR/fleet/report.py",
            "async": true
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "SubagentStart": [
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "$ORCHESTRATOR_DIR/.venv/bin/python $ORCHESTRATOR_DIR/fleet/report.py",
            "async": true
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "SubagentStop": [
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "$ORCHESTRATOR_DIR/.venv/bin/python $ORCHESTRATOR_DIR/fleet/report.py",
            "async": true
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "TaskCreated": [
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "$ORCHESTRATOR_DIR/.venv/bin/python $ORCHESTRATOR_DIR/fleet/report.py",
            "async": true
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "TaskCompleted": [
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "$ORCHESTRATOR_DIR/.venv/bin/python $ORCHESTRATOR_DIR/fleet/report.py",
            "async": true
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "Notification": [
      {
        "matcher": "permission_prompt|idle_prompt|elicitation_dialog|elicitation_url_dialog|agent_needs_input",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "$ORCHESTRATOR_DIR/.venv/bin/python $ORCHESTRATOR_DIR/fleet/report.py",
            "async": true
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PostCompact": [
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "$ORCHESTRATOR_DIR/.venv/bin/python $ORCHESTRATOR_DIR/fleet/report.py",
            "async": true
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PostToolUseFailure": [
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "$ORCHESTRATOR_DIR/.venv/bin/python $ORCHESTRATOR_DIR/fleet/report.py",
            "async": true
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "$ORCHESTRATOR_DIR/.venv/bin/python $ORCHESTRATOR_DIR/fleet/report.py",
            "async": true
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "_comment_fleet": "Fleet Phase 0 (synapse#31): fleet/report.py rides every event above as an async command hook and posts nothing unless [fleet] enabled = true in config/synapse.toml, and nothing for a session that isn't the agent's own (launched with MS4CC_FLEET_AGENT=<handle>, or claimed with fleet/claim.py). statusLine is fleet/statusline.py, installed only while Fleet is on (bootstrap passes --argjson fleet); if settings.json already has a statusLine, the merge WRAPS it (passes its command base64-encoded via --wrap-b64, its output shown unchanged) and never replaces it, and with Fleet off it puts the wrapped one back. PreToolUse is used only by the activity layer ([fleet] activity = true); with it off the hook exits at once.",
  "statusLine": {
    "type": "command",
    "command": "$ORCHESTRATOR_DIR/.venv/bin/python $ORCHESTRATOR_DIR/fleet/statusline.py",
    "padding": 0
  }
}
